          "english": "A team of researchers led by Priyanka Joshi examined the degree to which men and women relied on \"communicative abstraction\" to verbally convey their ideas and emotions. Communicative abstraction, according to the researchers, reflects the tendency of people to use \"abstract speech that focuses on the broader picture and __(26)__ purpose of action rather than concrete speech focusing on details and the means of __(27)__ action.\" Interestingly, they found that men were far more likely to speak in the abstract than were women.",
